{"story_id":88501,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:34:06","headline_en":"Adulterated liquor kills 15 people in Manipur Chandel district","headline_hi":"मणिपुर के चंदेल जिले में मिलावटी शराब से 15 लोगों की मौत","payload_en":{"story_id":88501,"headline":"Adulterated liquor kills 15 people in Manipur Chandel district","counts":{"articles":5,"independent_sources":5,"outlets":5},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Amar Ujala","Dynamite News Hindi","IBC24","Live Hindustan","News18 Hindi"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":88501,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-21T01:34:06","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life","justice"],"tertiary":["health","crime"]},"places":["manipur"],"people":["Khemchand Singh","Shija Hospital","Y Khemchand","Yumnam Khemchand","Kakching","Sugnu","Babina Hospital","Chakpi Karong"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On 20 November, 15 people died in Chandel district, Manipur, after consuming adulterated liquor over the past three days.","ids":[154592],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3]}],[{"text":"The incident occurred after consuming locally made liquor in Chakpi Karong, Chandel district.","ids":[154587],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"Chief Minister Yunnman Khemchand Singh reached the hospital to know the condition of the patients and assured help.","ids":[154594],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"On 20 November 2026, Chief Minister Yunnman Singh reached Shija Hospital.","ids":[154600],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Chief Minister Khemchand Yumnam reached the hospital (Shija Hospital, Babina Hospital) after the incident.","ids":[154611],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"On Friday evening, Chief Minister Yunnman Singh visited two hospitals to assess the condition of patients.","ids":[154606],"class":"single","sources":[5]},{"text":"Chief Minister Y Khemchand Chandel K visited Shija Hospitals and Research Institute.","ids":[154584],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"15 people died in Chandel district, Manipur, over three days.","ids":[154582],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"Over the past 48 hours, 15 people died in Chandel district after consuming suspected illicit liquor.","ids":[154604],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"The liquor was purchased from Sugnu in Kakching district.","ids":[154586],"class":"unverified","sources":[2,4]},{"text":"Police officials suspect the cause is methanol poisoning.","ids":[154585],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"The government would conduct an enquiry and punish the culprits, Chief Minister Khemchand Yumnam said.","ids":[154590],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Initial investigations suggest the presence of poisonous methanol in locally prepared liquor.","ids":[154596],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Approximately 140 patients arrived at Shija Hospital, and three patients are in critical condition and undergoing hemodialysis, Dr. Chetan Khundongbam said.","ids":[154597,154602],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"More than 140 patients were treated at Shija Hospital, Lamphelpat, and more than 41 patients were admitted at Singh said.","ids":[154607,154608],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"The government would get the incident investigated, and the guilty would be punished, Singh said.","ids":[154613,154614],"class":"single","sources":[5]},{"text":"The liquor was purchased from Sugnu in Kakching district, and the liquor consumed by the deceased was purchased from Sugnu in Kakching district, Chandel Police Superintendent Dharmendra Kumar said.","ids":[154609],"class":"single","sources":[5]},{"text":"There is no information about local liquor production in Chandel.","ids":[154610],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"About 150 people were hospitalized, 150 patients have currently come to Shija Hospital for examination, and besides this, many patients were undergoing similar treatment in Babina Hospital.","ids":[154601],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Hemodialysis is a procedure used to remove toxic substances from the body and assist the kidneys.","ids":[154598],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","happened","say","say","numbers","explained"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://hindi.news18.com/news/nation/15-dead-around-125-people-hospitalised-after-suspected-methanol-mix-liquor-poisoning-in-manipur-chandel-11001387.html","outlet":"News18 Hindi","title":"शराब समझकर पी गए जहर, 15 लोगों ने तोड़ा दम, 125 पहुंचे अस्पताल, मणिपुर में दिखा मौत का तांडव","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.ibc24.in/country/manipur-spurious-liquor-tragedy-15-people-die-after-consuming-spurious-liquor-in-chandel-district-manipur-3837273.html","outlet":"IBC24","title":"एक बार जहरीली शराब ने उजाड़े कई घर, अब तक 15 लोगों की मौत, अस्पताल पहुंचे सीएम","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.amarujala.com/india-news/manipur-toxic-liquor-tragedy-cm-reviews-arrangements-assures-strict-action-against-those-responsible-2026-11-20","outlet":"Amar Ujala","title":"मणिपुर में जहरीली शराब से हाहाकार: मरने वालों की संख्या 15 हुई; सीएम ने अस्पताल पहुंचकर क्या दिए निर्देश?","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.livehindustan.com/national/big-tragedy-in-manipur-15-dead-around-180-hospitalised-after-suspected-methanol-poisoning-in-chandel-201795191670269.html","outlet":"Live Hindustan","title":"मणिपुर में बड़ी और नई ट्रैजेडी, 15 की मौत; 180 से ज्यादा लोग बीमार, अस्पताल पहुंचे CM युमनाम खेमचंद","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://hindi.dynamitenews.com/national/manipur-news-chandel-district-poisonous-liquor-liquor-tragedy-patients-hospitalized-imphal-news","outlet":"Dynamite News Hindi","title":"मणिपुर में जहरीली शराब बनी काल, करीब 15 लोगों की मौत, 180 से ज्यादा अस्पताल में भर्ती","perspective":"